	(text "POWER: regulated USB 5V, >=1A dedicated source; J2.1 <=100mA.\nNo CC-current sensing: do not assume a PC USB port can supply full load.\nU3 exposed pad GND + thermal vias/copper; target thetaJA <=65C/W, ambient <=40C.\nJ2 GPIO18/19 are 3.3V logic signals, not 100mA load drivers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
